---

<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-15 md:py-section-gap bg-pastel-pink w-full relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-16 md:w-2/3 relative z-10">
      <h2 class="text-headline-xl font-semibold text-on-background mb-4">Realita Operasional Harian</h2>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Ketika bisnis berkembang, beban manual seringkali menguras energi tim, menyebabkan respon lambat dan prospek yang menguap begitu saja.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="md:col-span-7 bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border-2 border-surface-dim relative shadow-md md:-rotate-1 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform">
        <div class="absolute -top-5 -left-5 w-14 h-14 bg-error text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shadow-lg transform -rotate-12">#1</div>
        <h3 class="text-headline-lg font-semibold mb-3 mt-4">Waktu Respon Terlalu Lama</h3>
        <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">Tim Anda kewalahan menjawab pertanyaan rutin yang itu-itu saja, membuat pelanggan berharga menunggu dan pindah ke kompetitor.</p>
        <div class="bg-surface-bright p-6 rounded-xl border border-surface-dim relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 right-2 rotate-12 text-error font-bold text-sm squiggle-underline">"Balesnya lama banget sih!"</div>
          <div class="space-y-3 opacity-70">
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-3 border-l-4 border-error">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-error text-lg">warning</span>
              <span class="text-sm truncate">Chat dari Kak Budi (Menunggu 2 jam)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-3 border-l-4 border-error/70">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-error/70 text-lg">warning</span>
              <span class="text-sm truncate">Tanya stok sepatu ukuran 42 (Menunggu 1.5 jam)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-3 border-l-4 border-error/40">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-error/40 text-lg">warning</span>
              <span class="text-sm truncate">Komplain pengiriman (Menunggu 1 jam)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden md:flex md:col-span-1 justify-center items-center">
        <svg class="w-full h-full text-tomato" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 100 200">
          <path d="M10 10 C 90 10, 10 190, 90 190" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="4"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border-2 border-surface-dim mt-0 md:mt-24 relative shadow-md md:rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform">
        <div class="absolute -top-5 -right-5 w-14 h-14 bg-secondary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shadow-lg transform rotate-12">#2</div>
        <h3 class="text-headline-md font-semibold mb-3 mt-4">Prospek Lupa Di-Follow Up</h3>
        <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">Pencatatan manual membuat banyak calon klien berpotensi tinggi lepas dari genggaman. Uang hilang di atas meja.</p>
        <div class="bg-yellow-100 p-6 rounded-sm shadow-sm relative transform -rotate-2">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-4 text-sm space-y-2 opacity-80">
            <li class="line-through">Follow up Client A (Telat 3 hari)</li>
            <li class="line-through">Kirim Invoice B (Lupa)</li>
            <li class="text-red-600 font-bold">BALAS EMAIL PAK JOKO!!!</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
